{
  "_about": "Maps AutoSplit part tags to layer names in the hand-cut Salena FA rig (Salena Turnaround AI image test.psd, group FA). Names only, no artwork. Regexes match the layer name case-insensitively and must match the whole name. A tag listed here but missing from a run counts as a miss.",
